#      USB Class Definition for Communication Devices Data Interface. (CDC Data)
#    This file is prepared as per the Specification Revision 1.0.
#    This file is prepared as per the USB Class Definitions for Communication
#      Devices v1.1
#
#  REVISION HISTORY
